1. DEFINITIONS
================================================================================

"Software" means the EOCS Analytics code package, including:
  - dbt (data build tool) transformation models
  - SQL query libraries
  - Documentation and data dictionaries
  - Synthetic test data
  - Configuration templates
  - All updates provided under active maintenance

"Authorized Environment" means Licensee's own data infrastructure (Snowflake, 
PostgreSQL, SQL Server, BigQuery, Redshift, or other supported databases) 
where the Software is deployed.

"PACES" means the Patient-centered Episodes of Care Stratified by risk episode 
grouper, licensed separately from PACES Inc.

"License Fee" means the fees set forth in Schedule A attached hereto, as may 
be amended from time to time.

