4. DATA SOVEREIGNTY AND PRIVACY
================================================================================

4.1 YOUR DATA, YOUR CONTROL
The Software is designed to run entirely within Licensee's Authorized 
Environment. EOCS does NOT:

  - Host, store, process, or access Licensee's data
  - Require data transmission to EOCS systems
  - Maintain custody of any Protected Health Information (PHI)
  - Require a Business Associate Agreement (BAA) under HIPAA

4.2 LICENSEE RESPONSIBILITIES
Licensee is solely responsible for:

  - Data security within their Authorized Environment
  - Compliance with HIPAA, GDPR, or other applicable privacy regulations
  - Access controls for the Software and resulting analytics
  - Backup and disaster recovery of their data and Software installation

4.3 NO PHI EXPOSURE
This Agreement does not create any obligation for EOCS to handle, process, 
or secure PHI. All PHI remains within Licensee's security boundary.

